  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1206433/description_22e988f3-312d-41f4-9254-7110bb3c0326.png\" alt=\"axscolours\" width=\"745\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這隻微小的資源包將一隻可愛的墨西哥鈍口螈加入永恆的圖騰。墨西哥鈍口螈會漸變顏色。</p>\n<p>主要紋素材來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nova_wostra/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nova_Wostra</a> 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixel-perfection-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection Legacy</a>。從 3.0 版本開始，紋素材取自我的資源包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixel-perfection-fidelity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection Fidelity。</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>其他資源包</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixel-perfection-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x FARMER'S DELIGHT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixel-perfection-x-dehydration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x DEHYDRATION</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixel-perfection-x-controlify\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Perfection x CONTROLIFY</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ppl-alternative-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Alternative GUI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-solid-theme-for-jade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade 的新實色主題</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/greek-tile-theme-for-jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade 的希臘磚塊主題</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ppl-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Compat Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ppl-hodgepodge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PPL Hodgepodge</a></li>\n</ul>",
